1
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,580
I've booked the ticket for you to go back home.

2
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:19,236
Why don't you keep me for a few more days?

3
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,100
It's not impossible that we met two years ago.

4
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,700
Xu Wenshu, are you tired of pretending?

5
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,821
Not as tired as you, acting and winning awards.

6
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,421
