11
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,580
Yes, I'll take commercial films to make money.

12
00:00:39,981 --> 00:00:40,780
Rest early.

13
00:00:40,821 --> 00:00:41,901
Okay, hang up.

14
00:00:41,901 --> 00:00:43,381
Get me a bottle of red wine.

15
00:00:43,381 --> 00:00:44,381
Okay sir.

16
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:22,580
Shi Yuhao

17
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:14,620
A bear?

18
00:02:22,981 --> 00:02:24,861
Shi Yuhao, I fucked your uncle

19
00:02:25,901 --> 00:02:27,700
I'm on the goddamn stage.

20
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:29,620
Look up at me for a lifetime
